hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab baith kar guftagu farmate to aksar apni nazar aasman ki taraf uthate the."
"4","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam se apne walid [Abdullah bin Salam (Raziyallahu anhu)] se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kam hi guftagu farmate the [nazar uthaye baghair], aur [rawi ne] isi ki manind zikr kiya [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai]."
